#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#5 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ "[Jeum-sun]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#6 (mes)
- "Oh are you level 140 yet? I won't talk to any weak adventurers."
+ "Ah, você já é nível 140? Eu não falo com aventureiro fraco."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#7 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ "[Jeum-sun]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#8 (mes)
- "When I was a young girl many years ago there was a man who I had crush on. I didn't know to tell him how I felt..."
+ "Quando eu era mocinha, muitos anos atrás, havia um homem por quem eu era apaixonada. Eu não sabia como dizer a ele o que eu sentia..."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#9 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ "[Jeum-sun]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#10 (mes)
- "I used to tease his Peco Peco and wanted him to notice that I was interested. This went on and on for a while."
+ "Eu implicava com o Peco Peco dele para ver se ele percebia que eu estava interessada. Isso durou um bom tempo."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#11 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ "[Jeum-sun]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#12 (mes)
- "Then we started dating somehow. It's still embarrasing to talk about it."
+ "Aí, de algum jeito, a gente começou a namorar. Ainda me dá vergonha falar disso."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#13 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ "[Jeum-sun]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#14 (mes)
- "Anyway, we got married when we became old enough to marry. He used to say sorry for not being able to afford to buy a ring for me."
+ "Enfim, a gente se casou quando ficou com idade de casar. Ele vivia pedindo desculpa por não ter dinheiro para me comprar um anel."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#15 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ "[Jeum-sun]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#16 (mes)
- "It has been 40 years since we were married and he still says ^0000ff'Darling~ Do you want to have a ring?'^000000."
+ "Já se passaram 40 anos desde que a gente se casou e ele ainda diz ^0000ff'Querida~ Você quer um anel?'^000000."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#17 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ "[Jeum-sun]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#18 (mes)
- "I told him.. What good is a ring for an old lady?"
+ "Eu dizia a ele.. Para que serve um anel para uma velha?"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#19 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ "[Jeum-sun]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#20 (mes)
- "I should have stopped him. I still remember his face early."
+ "Eu devia ter impedido ele. Ainda me lembro do rosto dele naquela manhã."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#21 (select)
- "What happened to him?"
+ "O que aconteceu com ele?"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#22 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ "[Jeum-sun]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#23 (mes)
