+ "[Erudito Mágico]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#147 (mes)
- "The spaces are under control."
+ "Os espaços estão sob controle."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#148 (mes)
- "Please wait for a minute."
