#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#149 (mes)
- "[Magic Scholar]"
+ "[Erudito Mágico]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#150 (mes)
- "Okay, I got it. Please come back again if you change your mind."
