#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#151 (mes)
- "[Magic Scholar]"
+ "[Erudito Mágico]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#152 (mes)
- "I am researching the dimensional cracks in space here."
+ "Eu pesquiso as fendas dimensionais do espaço aqui."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#153 (mes)
- "[Magic Scholar]"
+ "[Erudito Mágico]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#154 (mes)
- "My research is to stabilize the space here with magic to utilize it for dimensional travel."
+ "A minha pesquisa é estabilizar o espaço daqui com magia, para usá-lo em viagem dimensional."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#155 (mes)
- "[Magic Scholar]"
+ "[Erudito Mágico]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#156 (mes)
- "This particular crack in space goes to a memory of the past. Many adventurers have been in there but no one will tell me what is in there..."
+ "Esta fenda em especial leva a uma lembrança do passado. Muitos aventureiros já estiveram lá, mas ninguém me conta o que tem lá dentro..."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#157 (mes)
- "[Magic Scholar]"
+ "[Erudito Mágico]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#158 (mes)
- "And there's this strange sign here that records names and times on it which I can only assume belongs to those adventurers."
+ "E tem este quadro estranho aqui, que registra nomes e tempos, e eu só posso supor que sejam daqueles aventureiros."
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#159 (mes)
- "[Magic Scholar]"
+ "[Erudito Mágico]"
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#160 (mes)
